                                    <span>Peak Target: <strong style="color:#d97706;">May-27 (50,000 PCS)</strong></span>
                                    <span id="graphActiveMonthPill">Active Output: <strong style="color:#0284c7;">25,000 PCS (Sep-26)</strong></span>
                                </div>
